        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.1.9+ACT.1.10+ACT.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Acts 1.9–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After the Lord Jesus had talked with them, he was taken up to heaven and sat at the right side of God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The disciples went and preached everywhere, and the Lord worked with them and proved that their preaching was true by the miracles that were performed.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The women went to Peter and his friends and gave them a brief account of all they had been told. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After this, Jesus himself sent out through his disciples from the east to the west the sacred and ever-living message of eternal salvation.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
